    (why "bound names, known calls of any arity, package and import scope, record-backed self with its own receiver slot, class member dispatch, class construction, interface dispatch, typed and template overloads, mutable local frames, arrays, save/restore/discard as one snapshot, and source-level if/else, loop, while, for, switch, labeled break/continue and try/throw/catch through bml-native-source-control effect rows give method bodies and model layers a real class/control/state floor, and every one of those proofs crosses four-way; target assembly receipts and native metal/emit rows keep the metal-plane claim honest; Form-native Mach-O and ELF object wrappers prove the first per-target object floors without clang as compiler or assembler, and form-elf-exec proves the Android ELF executable shape with _start write+exit bytes without clang, assembler, or linker; Docker Linux/arm64 and an authorized Android adb arm64 device executed that image and verified stdout FORM ELF, empty stderr, and exit 42; a generated macOS arm64 binary and Android arm64 binary exchanged a core-axiom receipt over adb-forward TCP and agreed on a 2048 width-8 bounded sample window; a generated Android arm64 .so is carried inside the Coherence Sense APK with matching APK-entry SHA, while direct wifi-tcp is blocked by duplicate-address and timeout evidence; Form-native JIT rows, the lowered residual cluster, the Value-ABI float/vector/string-name/JIT-offer span, numeric conversion/transcendental rows, tensor quantization, and the tensor emitter recipe run through the fourth arm so Android is not coupled to a clang runtime dependency; oracle-learning choice samples let native recipes earn runtime selection without losing the third-party teacher; what current-unsupported names is each family's open work, with the code point where it closes")))
